# Icon and screenshot assets

Place the following here once generated:

- `icon-256.png` - App icon (256x256)
- `icon-tray.ico` - Tray icon (multi-resolution ICO: 16, 32, 48)
- `social-preview.png` - GitHub social preview card (1280x640)
- `installer-banner.bmp` - WiX installer welcome banner (493x312)
- `installer-header.bmp` - WiX installer top header (493x58)
- `demo.gif` - Mount → write → eject animation

See `docs/icon-prompts.md` for AI generation prompts.
